      "richText": "<article class=\"markdown-body entry-content container-lg\" itemprop=\"text\"><div align=\"center\" dir=\"auto\">\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dinobot22/antigravity-ssh-proxy/main/ATP.jpg\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dinobot22/antigravity-ssh-proxy/main/ATP.jpg\" width=\"128\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></a>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h1 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Antigravity SSH Proxy (ATP)</h1><a id=\"user-content-antigravity-ssh-proxy-atp\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Antigravity SSH Proxy (ATP)\" href=\"#antigravity-ssh-proxy-atp\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>简体中文</strong> · <a href=\"/dinobot22/antigravity-ssh-proxy/blob/main/README.en.md\">English</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://open-vsx.org/extension/dinobot22/antigravity-ssh-proxy\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/167339f231b8c8fc848f99499c09ab077f6ee34b854655e1a7dba41b011066df/68747470733a2f2f696d672e736869656c64732e696f2f6f70656e2d7673782f762f64696e6f626f7432322f616e7469677261766974792d7373682d70726f7879\" alt=\"Version\" data-canonical-src=\"https://img.shields.io/open-vsx/v/dinobot22/antigravity-ssh-proxy\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/dinobot22/antigravity-ssh-proxy\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/6709076d8ce51fbb3ef9a0b20f47598d2f3774f42d034076cc5ed5172c16d188/68747470733a2f2f696d672e736869656c64732e696f2f6769746875622f73746172732f64696e6f626f7432322f616e7469677261766974792d7373682d70726f7879\" alt=\"GitHub stars\" data-canonical-src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/stars/dinobot22/antigravity-ssh-proxy\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/dinobot22/antigravity-ssh-proxy/issues\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/a8a5c6de65b27312ba5f45044bd34382f89a41346166de6b5536ee50b5b362b9/68747470733a2f2f696d672e736869656c64732e696f2f6769746875622f6973737565732f64696e6f626f7432322f616e7469677261766974792d7373682d70726f7879\" alt=\"GitHub issues\" data-canonical-src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/issues/dinobot22/antigravity-ssh-proxy\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/dinobot22/antigravity-ssh-proxy/blob/main/LICENSE\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/c13547d8029eb99bc881fe66beab214f86c67fb473c07b5c42c480957d35cabb/68747470733a2f2f696d672e736869656c64732e696f2f6769746875622f6c6963656e73652f64696e6f626f7432322f616e7469677261766974792d7373682d70726f7879\" alt=\"License\" data-canonical-src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/license/dinobot22/antigravity-ssh-proxy\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></a></p>\n</div>\n这是一个专为 **Antigravity** 设计的扩展（[Open VSX 地址](<a href=\"https://open-vsx.org/extension/dinobot22/antigravity-ssh-proxy\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://open-vsx.org/extension/dinobot22/antigravity-ssh-proxy</a>) ， 用于将 SSH 远程服务器的网络流量通过反向隧道路由至本地代理, 实现远程服务器复用本地的代理能力，从而恢复SSH远程服务器上的 AI 功能。\n<blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">✨ <strong>无需 root 权限</strong> - 所有操作均在用户空间完成，安全便捷！</p>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>注意:</strong> 支持 <strong>Linux 远程服务器 (x86_64 / amd64)</strong>。ARM64 架构为<strong>实验性支持</strong>（需 v0.0.15+）。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">本项目基于 <a href=\"https://github.com/wang-muhan/antigravity-interface\">wang-muhan/antigravity-interface</a> 进行二次开发，感谢原作者的出色工作！</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\"><g-emoji class=\"g-emoji\" alias=\"warning\">⚠️</g-emoji> 重要：需要双端安装</h2><a id=\"user-content-️-重要需要双端安装\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: ⚠️ 重要：需要双端安装\" href=\"#️-重要需要双端安装\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">此插件必须同时安装在 <strong>本地</strong> 和 <strong>远程服务器</strong> 上：</p>\n<markdown-accessiblity-table><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>位置</th>\n<th>职责</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>本地</strong></td>\n<td>管理 SSH 端口转发配置 (<code>~/.ssh/config.antigravity</code>)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>远程</strong></td>\n<td>配置 Language Server 代理包装器 (mgraftcp)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>\n<hr>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">功能特性</h2><a id=\"user-content-功能特性\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 功能特性\" href=\"#功能特性\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><strong>自动代理配置</strong>：自动部署 <code>mgraftcp</code> 并配置代理。</li>\n<li><strong>SSH 反向隧道</strong>：通过 SSH 端口转发将流量路由到本地代理。</li>\n<li><strong>进程重定向</strong>：自动拦截并重定向语言服务器进程。</li>\n<li><strong>DNS 污染防护</strong>：集成 FakeDNS 功能，有效解决 DNS 污染导致的连接问题，确保稳定连接。</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">快速开始</h2><a id=\"user-content-快速开始\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 快速开始\" href=\"#快速开始\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h3 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">前置条件</h3><a id=\"user-content-前置条件\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 前置条件\" href=\"#前置条件\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">在开始之前，请确保满足以下条件：</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>✅ 本地代理软件（如 Clash、V2Ray）已启动并正常运行</li>\n<li>✅ 本地 Antigravity 的 AI 功能可以正常使用（这表明您的网络环境已正确配置）</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h3 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">配置步骤</h3><a id=\"user-content-配置步骤\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 配置步骤\" href=\"#配置步骤\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Step 1 — 本地安装与配置</strong></p>\n<ol dir=\"auto\">\n<li>打开一个本地的 Antigravity项目并在扩展中搜索并安装 <strong>Antigravity SSH Proxy</strong> 插件(目前安装量比较小,可能需要按名称排序才能找到)</li>\n<li>安装成功后点击左下角 <strong>ATP 面板</strong>，配置 <code>localProxyPort</code> 为您本地代理端口（如 <code>7890</code>）</li>\n<li>检查面板状态，确认本地配置无异常.</li>\n</ol>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Step 2 — 远程安装</strong></p>\n<ol dir=\"auto\">\n<li>使用 Antigravity SSH 连接到远程 Linux 服务器. PS: 步骤一启动的本地Antigravity窗口,尽量不要关闭</li>\n<li>在插件视图的 <strong>\"SSH: [服务器名]\"</strong> 分类下，再次安装本插件</li>\n</ol>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Step 3 — 激活并验证</strong></p>\n<ol dir=\"auto\">\n<li>按照提示执行 <strong>Reload Window</strong> 重启窗口. PS: 由于远程的需要对language server进行wrapper, 插件有的时候会提示您<strong>多次</strong>重启远程窗口,<strong>按提示重启</strong>. 本地的Antigravity窗口一般不需要重启)</li>\n<li>打开右下角 <strong>ATP 面板</strong>，运行 <strong>连接诊断</strong> 检查代理状态</li>\n<li>显示正常后，远程 AI 功能即可使用 🎉</li>\n</ol>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Step 4 — 简单重试</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">如果发现功能不能正常使用时:</p>\n<ol dir=\"auto\">\n<li>关闭所有的(本地+远程)Antigravity窗口</li>\n<li>先打开本地的Antigravity窗口,等待本地插件启动完成(左下角ATP变绿),</li>\n<li>再点击左边的SSH链接远程服务器进行重试, 连接远程终端时一般有两个选项</li>\n</ol>\n<blockquote>\n<ol dir=\"auto\">\n<li>在当前窗口链接远程服务(connect SSH host in current window)</li>\n<li>打开新窗口链接远程服务(connect SSH host in new window) <strong>&lt;-- 选择这个</strong></li>\n</ol>\n</blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">进行重试,查看是否可行</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>当系统提示需要重启窗口时，请重启以确保功能正常使用</strong></p>\n<hr>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h3 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">故障排查</h3><a id=\"user-content-故障排查\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 故障排查\" href=\"#故障排查\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">如果配置+重试后仍无法正常使用，提交Bug日志时请附带一下远程链接服务器的日志信息：</p>\n<blockquote>\n<ol dir=\"auto\">\n<li>ATP页面中运行诊断, 复制诊断结果</li>\n<li>Antigravity的Output 面板内容中的</li>\n</ol>\n<markdown-accessiblity-table><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>日志频道</th>\n<th>查看路径</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Antigravity</code></td>\n<td>Output 面板 → Antigravity</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Antigravity SSH Proxy</code></td>\n<td>Output 面板 → Antigravity SSH Proxy</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n<ol start=\"4\" dir=\"auto\">\n<li>一些额外的系统信息</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"   uname -a                          # 内核版本\n   uname -m                          # 架构 (x86_64/aarch64)\n   ps -aux |grep language_server     # 查看实际启动的language_server\n   cat /proc/sys/kernel/yama/ptrace_scope  # Ptrace 权限信息\n   ls -la /.dockerenv                # 是否在 Docker 中\n   lscpu | grep -i aes               # 查看cpu情况\n   ps -aux | grep language_server\"><pre>   uname -a                          <span class=\"pl-c\"><span class=\"pl-c\">#</span> 内核版本</span>\n   uname -m                          <span class=\"pl-c\"><span class=\"pl-c\">#</span> 架构 (x86_64/aarch64)</span>\n   ps -aux <span class=\"pl-k\">|</span>grep language_server     <span class=\"pl-c\"><span class=\"pl-c\">#</span> 查看实际启动的language_server</span>\n   cat /proc/sys/kernel/yama/ptrace_scope  <span class=\"pl-c\"><span class=\"pl-c\">#</span> Ptrace 权限信息</span>\n   ls -la /.dockerenv                <span class=\"pl-c\"><span class=\"pl-c\">#</span> 是否在 Docker 中</span>\n   lscpu <span class=\"pl-k\">|</span> grep -i aes               <span class=\"pl-c\"><span class=\"pl-c\">#</span> 查看cpu情况</span>\n   ps -aux <span class=\"pl-k\">|</span> grep language_server</pre></div>\n</blockquote>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">扩展设置</h2><a id=\"user-content-扩展设置\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 扩展设置\" href=\"#扩展设置\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<markdown-accessiblity-table><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>设置</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>enableLocalForwarding</code></td>\n<td>启用 SSH 反向隧道转发。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>localProxyPort</code></td>\n<td>本地计算机上的代理端口。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>remoteProxyHost</code></td>\n<td>远程服务器上的代理主机地址。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>remoteProxyPort</code></td>\n<td>远程服务器上的代理端口。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>showStatusOnStartup</code></td>\n<td>连接远程服务器时显示状态通知。</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">卸载说明</h2><a id=\"user-content-卸载说明\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 卸载说明\" href=\"#卸载说明\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">卸载前，请先执行 <strong>Antigravity SSH Proxy: Rollback Remote Environment</strong> 命令以恢复原始的 Language Server。</p>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">环境要求</h2><a id=\"user-content-环境要求\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 环境要求\" href=\"#环境要求\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>远程服务器的 SSH 访问权限。</li>\n<li>Linux 远程服务器（支持 x86_64/amd64，ARM64 为实验性支持，需 v0.0.15+）。</li>\n<li>本地运行的代理软件（如 Clash、V2Ray）。</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">致谢</h2><a id=\"user-content-致谢\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 致谢\" href=\"#致谢\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">特别感谢以下项目：</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/hmgle/graftcp\">graftcp</a>: 提供了核心代理功能。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/wang-muhan/antigravity-interface\">antigravity-interface</a>: 提供了最初的插件实现。</li>\n</ul>\n</article>",
